  "translation": "Gomme go yena go kgobokeditšwe banna ba pholletšego, bana ba go se loke, gomme ba ithatafatša kgahlanong le Rehoboamo morwa Shelomo; gomme Rehoboamo a be moshaanyana, mohlelwa wa pela, gomme a sa kgone go ikgethagatša mahlong a bona.",
